[00:27.00]It's not a game
{"这并非一场游戏"}
[00:29.00]I'm not a robot AI challenging you
{"我不是挑战你的机械人工智能"}
[00:35.00]I'm not a phantom
{"我也并非幻影"}
[00:37.00]I'm in your face and
{"我就站在你面前"}
[00:39.00]I'm here to see it through
{"我必将见证结局"}
[00:43.00]Right before your eyes
{"就在你眼前"}
[00:46.00]Watch us multiply
{"看着我们不断壮大"}
[00:51.00]Come to claim our rights.It's time!
{"来夺回属于我们的权利 就是现在"}
[00:57.00]As our power grows
{"随着力量增长"}
[01:03.00]Tryin' to stop us shows
{"试图阻挡只会证明"}
[01:06.00]Might as well go try'n stop time
{"不如去尝试让时间停摆"}
[01:26.00]So you know that we're out there
{"所以你知道我们存在"}
[01:29.00]Swatting lies in the making
{"击碎编织中的谎言"}
[01:33.00]Can't move fast without breaking
{"不破不立难以前行"}
[01:36.00]Can't hold on or life won't change
{"固步自封永无改变"}
[01:40.00]And our voices ring out yeah
{"我们的呐喊响彻云霄"}
[01:43.00]Took the mask off to feel free
{"摘下面具重获自由"}
[01:47.00]Fought it out in the debris
{"在废墟中抗争不休"}
[01:50.00]Now we know that life will change
{"如今我们知晓变革将至"}
[02:24.00]Ain't it a shame
{"难道不可悲吗"}
[02:26.00]I'm not a figment of your ailing old mind
{"我不是你腐朽思维的幻象"}
[02:32.00]I'm just as real as
{"我和你同样真实"}
[02:33.00]I'm just as dangerous
{"我和你同样危险"}
[02:35.00]As you, so know you'll find
{"所以你终将尝到"}
[02:40.00]A taste of your own meds
{"自己种下的苦果"}
[02:43.00]Fire in every breath
{"烈焰在每次呼吸中燃烧"}
[02:47.00]Fire inside your head,your heart
{"烈焰在你脑海与心中翻腾"}
[02:53.00]And as your crippled brain
{"当你残破的思绪"}
[02:58.00]Tries to fight in vain
{"徒劳地试图抵抗"}
[03:01.00]Your empire will fall apart
{"你的帝国终将分崩离析"}
[03:21.00]And you'll know we were out there
{"你会明白我们始终存在"}
[03:25.00]Swatted lies in the making
{"粉碎编织中的谎言"}
[03:29.00]Your empire for the taking
