[03:32.00]Can't hold on or life won't change
{"若不放手 生活永无改变"}
[03:36.00]And our voices rang out here
{"我们的呐喊在此回荡"}
[03:39.00]Took the mask off to feel free
{"揭下面具重获自由"}
[03:44.00]Fought it out in the debris
